    <question_explanation no="1" id="PRB-E33450F84E78653E-Q1">
      <question_stem>다음 논리 회로에서 출력 $X$의 논리식은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>논리</keyword>
        <keyword>회로에서</keyword>
        <keyword>출력</keyword>
        <keyword>논리식</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$A \bar{B} + \bar{A} B$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>[유형] 핵심 개념·이론 이해형 · 옳은·적절한 것 고르기
[키워드] 논리, 출력, 논리식
[풀이] 옳은 것을 고르는 문제다. 옳은 선지는 ①, 틀린 선지는 ②·③·④이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="O · 정답">
          <choice_text>$A \bar{B} + \bar{A} B$</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳은 내용이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="X">
          <choice_text>$AB ( A + B )$</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳지 않은 내용이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="X">
          <choice_text>$( \bar{A} + B ) ( A + \bar{B} )$</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳지 않은 내용이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="X">
          <choice_text>$AB$</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳지 않은 내용이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
